  "description": "Oman Qatar Insurance Company SAOG (OQIC), established in 2004 and headquartered in Al Khuwair, Muscat, is a subsidiary of Qatar Insurance Group (QIC) underwriting personal and commercial insurance across Oman and the GCC. Following its merger by incorporation with Vision Insurance SAOG effective 1 January 2023, OQIC emerged as Oman's third-largest insurer by gross written premium and a dominant player in Oman's medical and life market. Its portfolio spans property and casualty, medical and life, and marine and energy lines, backed by an inaugural 'A-' S&P Global credit rating and a revamped direct-to-consumer digital retail portal (oqic-insured.com).",
